# Local shadow of the neohiro GitHub org
#
# This directory mirrors the public neohiro/neohiro org profile repo and
# individual repos (ExploitProtection, dnscrypt-proxy-gui, Cripple-NetStrip,
# auto-resume, windows, frenzypenguin-media) as a working copy. It is NOT
# tracked by any git tree in this workspace.
#
# If you intend to make upstream changes, use the canonical GitHub workflow:
#   gh repo clone neohiro/<repo>
#   …edit…
#   gh pr create
#
# If you need a local mirror for offline work, use:
#   git clone https://github.com/neohiro/<repo> /shared/mirror/<repo>
# (see network/scripts/bootstrap.sh for the shared drive convention)
#
# The doctor rules in neohiro-doctor check this directory for the same things
# as the live workspace (line endings, drift vs master, structure). The CRLF
# discipline in .gitattributes at this level applies to files in this shadow.

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
